        {
          time: 'Morning',
          icon: '🌅',
          title: 'Bled Island by Pletna Boat',
          text: 'Bled Island — the only natural island in Slovenia — sits at the lake\'s centre, topped by the 17th-century Assumption of Mary Church. Row there by traditional wooden pletna boat from the main promenade; the 20-minute ride costs around €15 return per person. Ring the church\'s wishing bell (legend says wishes come true if you ring it three times) and climb the 99 stone steps to the baroque interior. Early morning light on the lake is breathtaking.',
